MiniGameCollectionRules: [ {
id: 329856001,
param: {
content: [ "One Line – Connect all blocks with a single continuous line without lifting your finger or retracing.|Tic Tac Toe – Take turns placing X or O in a 3×3 grid; be the first to get three in a row horizontally", " vertically", " or diagonally.|Fruit Merge – Combine identical fruits to create higher-tier ones and harvest giant watermelons.|Water Sort – Pour colored water between tubes to sort all same-colored liquids into individual containers.|Onet – Find and remove matching pairs of cards by flipping them over until the board is cleared.|Mahjong – Remove matching pairs of tiles by clearing blocked ones until all are eliminated.|Sudoku – Fill a 6×6 grid with digits 1-6 so each row", " column", " and 2×3 subgrid contains all numbers without repetition.|Block Slide – Strategically slide the blocks horizontally to make the upper blocks fall and achieve horizontal elimination." ]
}
} ],
